Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made it to Venice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, we're going in!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, you have to get out of the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Journal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.93,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I don't need to\Ntell you this, Vista.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But getting to the you-know-what\Nis our first priority here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Securing it will cement our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The disc is in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The vast amount of water will\Nslow down the freezing in the car,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:00:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so there's no better time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay. Just get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.08,0:01:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your definition of\Nvictory needs some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.04,0:01:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Beating Ice Boy into\Nthe ground and getting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the hell out of Dodge\Nwith the disc in hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,that's how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.14,0:01:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a dip, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I'm willing to wager.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My ice migrates faster than you can\Ndoggie paddle to the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I shouldn't have driven\Nthe car into here after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.06,0:01:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This bastard's ice attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.90,0:01:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They're unbeatable!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.22,0:01:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost like you've been knocked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not able to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not able to walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.26,0:02:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not able to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.52,0:02:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The goals of the world are born.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no hope to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We will continue to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We will continue to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:03:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We will continue to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of it while you still\Nhave the chance, so you're.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to use those vines as\Nropes are you as if i let you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,it's no use if i want these\Nvines to make it all the way
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,across to the banks i'm going\Nto need some warmer temperatures
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.46,0:03:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,this sub-zero cold is too\Nextreme for anything other than
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,tundra grass now who said anything\Nabout getting the vines to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.84,0:03:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Grass is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.82,0:03:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just what the doctor ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But I need more, and more, and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to fight the\Nbig one, grow me some grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Grow like your life
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,depends on it, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad you couldn't get\Nenough of the stuff to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,make it to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going there, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It finally froze.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Disaster avoided.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He made the frozen grass into\Na freakin' ski! Crafty dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.98,0:04:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who said you could use a snowboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.90,0:04:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be crazy to think this lunatic\Nwould let me off the hook that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.92,0:04:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this guy, white ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch off the deep breeze now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.22,0:04:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the ice is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The realm of ice is the realm of stasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cold's piercing embrace\Nsettles all into inertia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:04:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice halts everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:05:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hence the reason my stand, white\Nice, is the paragon of perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It can still the fury of the sea,\Nand soon you'll feel its power!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself up already! Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, go for the grass\Nthat's down in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That stuff you used as a board! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire with your right hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give it up, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it through your moronic skull already!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're powerless against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.18,0:05:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you withdraw Golden Wind's ability, the\Ngrass turns back into ordinary car parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.56,0:05:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning we can turn around and shoot\Nthe pieces at you like shrapnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be alright for\Nthe time being, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The good news is, you\Nbought us a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our primary objective at this point\Nis getting what we need and escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be sure the bastard won't\Nfall for the same strategy twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So forget about him and go, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crack that lion open like\Na pinata and find the disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll snatch it up and get out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need is a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.82,0:06:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But will hiding be enough to\Nfool that winter wonder freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a good chance that plan will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if it doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know for sure is this\Nguy isn't messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to think\Nabout what'll happen if
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,he catches up with\NBucciarati and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.48,0:06:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This deranged bastard needs to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no time, like now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.04,0:06:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll prove you're not as\Ninvincible as you think you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're forced to cover yourself\Nhead-to-toe in ice, how exactly do you breathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear the hiss of air coming\Nfrom the back of his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how he's breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Numbers one and two get into\Nposition to flank this strunzel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And the rest, get ready to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.98,0:07:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That nut job's looking here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, he's gonna do\Nthat ice thingy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the first thing on his\Nmind will be coming up for air.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he surfaces, I'll blast\Nthat blowhole with some bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready or not, here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, six bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We strike the moment he takes a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, numbers one and two are reporting\Nthat they can't find the breathing hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's how he's positioned!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,His head's angled up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.94,0:07:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The opening's covered!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.66,0:07:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, this plan's a non-starter!\NLet's retrieve! Pipe down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Break position and you\Ncan forget about treats!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that one and two?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:08:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some balls attacking\Nmy forehead like that! Meester!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.62,0:08:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You were trying to shoot the fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What stupid idea are you concocting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he looked down! There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, blast away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look sharp, we're gonna kill this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One and done, it's time to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.11,0:08:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you figured out how I was\Nbreathing and aim for that, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sub-zero temperatures bring\Neverything in the area to a halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Gases become liquids and\Nliquids become solids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look a little closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.94,0:08:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,See the suspended vapor now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:08:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bullet, Mista! That sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a ricocheting bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's White Ice's ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Gently Weeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd already created a\Nfrozen barrier of vapor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, it takes a lot of\Nenergy to make it work,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but it protects me from\Njust about anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,including your damn bolts and bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm protected by a barrier of stasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have you to thank for\Nthat little trick, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.22,0:09:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonah's prediction was right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Endless charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.54,0:09:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I go after that\Nstupid disc from the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.92,0:09:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not on your benches or in the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it wouldn't be in plain sight,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.62,0:09:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's nothing around here\Nthat even resembles a disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering how eager\NMista was to get over here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the hiding spot\Nmust be pretty close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.72,0:09:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The picture should give me a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:09:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Things just went from bad to worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista's at the end of his rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taking responsibility for\Nthis and is risking his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's just the mindset needed\Nto light your path in this darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is when things get interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've no doubt there will be sacrifices,\Nbut Masa and I have determinazione.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.40,0:10:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What the actual hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They stuck the thing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In a crevice of a statue?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I'm at point blank range.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,From right here, I should be able to\Ntake out his breathing vent and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can get close enough\Nto bypass his barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista is desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole ordeal, he's prepared\Nto pay for it with his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But this isn't simple grit\Nin the face of desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.20,0:10:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's saving us with Determinazione.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not martyrdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our road to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.64,0:11:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A computer disk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that's what you dubious\Nbastards were after all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A clear path to the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I have this, the boss can\Nsay goodbye to his secret identity!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left now is to capture Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I gotta do away with you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it, chuckle schmuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.22,0:11:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to put you\Nout of your misery! Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what it means\Nto have determination to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,forge your path through\Nthe darkness of light!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.78,0:11:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Guido Mista, arrested at 17\Non allegations of murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.32,0:11:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the extenuating\Ncircumstances surrounding the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,his self-defense plea was rejected and\Nhe was sentenced to 30 years in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.96,0:12:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I was actually happy before this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista had always been able to see the bright\Nside of things, but for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,he was truly scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, you're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the one who did this? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your story on the news, and\NI believe it was self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.70,0:12:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, from what I've seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.34,0:12:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you're a top-notch gunman, and your\Ninner strength is even more formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, a guy like yourself wouldn't\Nlast two years wasting away in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you pulled some strings on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.02,0:12:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me guess, you're a mafioso?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.40,0:12:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know a great restaurante.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're enjoying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You should try the bruschetta if\Nyou still have some room in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. Mi scusi. Si?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bruschetta for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And the others too, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Four bruschettas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, make it five.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be the lone man out now, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, getting back to what\NI was saying... I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually think we'd\Nmake an awesome team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm agreeing to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.82,0:13:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, order me a Dallas, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and some Tarot alle fragole.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are an odd one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:13:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.52,0:14:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista came to realize that each and every\Nperson has their own unique destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And while youth tends to\Nbe a difficult period,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,filled with seemingly endless setbacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,in the end, one always travels down\Nthe path they're destined to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The path is plain as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to follow\Nit to the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it there, through the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the path to victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you idiots just\Nrefuse to learn your lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Or were you not listening when I told\Nyou sub-zero temperatures freeze vapor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I were to take a frozen mass of\Nvapor and stuff it in my soup to melt down,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.78,0:15:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,then the vapor would return\Nto its original state.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And since that state's basically air,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm like a diver with a scuba tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a breathing vent to\Ntake in oxygen. Huh? Look at the van!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy deflected all six of the bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to beat this bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.34,0:15:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have all that determination\Ngoing for you, right, Mista?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Say your goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My determination is unwavering, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't given me yours, I\Nwould have never discovered my path.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The enlightened path that led me to\Nshove myself with my own bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.62,0:15:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.53,0:15:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The blood's congealed to my visor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.58,0:15:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Path through the murky\Ndarkness wasn't going to reveal
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.58,0:15:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,itself by blasting through\Nthat protective ice wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The easier route was to splash\Nblood all over your ugly mug!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.78,0:16:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the metal pole from earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.06,0:16:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nista, your bullet must have reshaped it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, that hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.78,0:16:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Something warm and wet is\Ntrickling down my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A moment ago, you asked\Nif I had determinazione.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm gonna show you what it's all\Nabout, but you gotta do the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see just how determined you are to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.06,0:16:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,be shot into the proverbial\Nhell frozen over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.08,0:16:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This bastard's still upright.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's worse, he's trying\Nto shove me back even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This lunatic is gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Merida, I gotta hurry\Nand yank this thing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet will come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't survive another blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to have resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:16:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now buckle up, bullets, and hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.36,0:17:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over till it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,White Ice gently weeps!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.94,0:17:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too much, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pass out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.00,0:17:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about what that means!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll fade away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.62,0:17:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've still got some\Nfight left in this body!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still pull the trigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.40,0:17:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we won!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the way you got him good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, you may have determination,\Nbut I've got even more, Guido Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.50,0:17:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to say, you dole\Nout some major damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kudos to you, amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:18:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,However, losing all that blood\Nwas actually to my advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I froze the blood you forced out of\Nme and created my own icy support.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It keeps that pesky spike from sinking\Nfurther into my neck, so I'm good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't beat me that\Neasily, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.88,0:18:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have a final bullet in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.42,0:18:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's now in your skull! I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.98,0:18:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It shines even brighter\Nthan the morning sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's shown us the way forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's put us on the\Npath toward tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We've won because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.86,0:18:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.18,0:19:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finally starting to realize\Nsomething about this Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a total rookie, but even so,\Nwhen he says something will happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,it eventually comes to fruition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My Determinazione was really Giorno's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.74,0:19:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It flooded my being without\Nme even realizing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he superseded\NBucciarati to become Cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.12,0:19:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,like he was guiding my every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell does he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like obsessing over\Nit won't do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.86,0:19:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We got the disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.60,0:19:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But could you please heal me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:19:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.23,0:20:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only able to do all that because I\Nknew you could fix me up after the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, before I bite the\Nbig one, heal me up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.74,0:20:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.04,0:20:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I should probably clarify.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.34,0:20:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind doesn't really fix things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It creates parts I can add to you,\Nso there'll be new body parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.64,0:20:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll imbue the bullets in you with life,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,replacing your damaged\Nblood vessels and tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, just get started, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and there's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.86,0:20:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I'm not actually healing your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you're still gonna have\Na bit of residual pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have to be so rough, Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Ande.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.92,0:20:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.86,0:20:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you\Nthere's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle down and take it\Nlike a mafioso. Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,there's about 18 more to go, and you'll\Nhave to strip if you want this to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.35,0:20:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm picking up two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.10,0:20:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like there's anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.34,0:20:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.46,0:21:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My guess is, you've\Nfound Mista and Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the lack of excitement\Nhas them longing for our return.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.64,0:21:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are! Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.38,0:21:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop doing it so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.28,0:21:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I leave my damn clothes on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.39,0:21:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.90,0:21:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.81,0:21:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.96,0:21:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something in my eyes! Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.30,0:21:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so hard to see in\Nthis early morning light.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep after it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.00,0:21:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not so rough, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.30,0:21:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaking you is all I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.48,0:22:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you got my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.42,0:22:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,won't be sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.42,0:22:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.36,0:22:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All I want to do is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.22,0:22:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.96,0:22:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.82,0:22:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much I'm going to free.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.02,0:22:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.74,0:22:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you must not do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you must not do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.66,0:22:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you must\Nnot do. I'm freaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.20,0:23:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Risotto, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.82,0:23:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're coming to Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.22,0:23:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Bucciarati and his\Nmen will take care of you.
